'''The Cat God''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be purchased for 2,000 XP in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea/Nagasaki]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. He is only available to use in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] (excluding [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]], [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[The Aku Realms]]).

